     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div> </div><div>I recently performed a regional analysis of differentially methylated regions using the following workflow:</div><div> </div><div>#filtering coverage, normalisation, ontarget region</div><div> </div><div>CH.filtered = filterByCoverage(CH, lo.count = 10, lo.perc = NULL, hi.count = NULL, hi.perc = NULL)<br>CH_filtered_norm = normalizeCoverage(CH.filtered)<br>data = read.table(&#39;path/to/region_list/file&#39;, header = FALSE)<br>colnames(data) = c(&#39;chr&#39;,&#39;start&#39;,&#39;end&#39;)<br>bed = with(data,GRanges(chr, IRanges (start,end)) )<br>ontarget = regionCounts(CH_filtered_norm , bed)</div><div> </div><div>#methylation detection<br><br>meth_targets = unite(ontarget)<br>mydiff_targets = calculateDiffMeth(meth_targets)</div><div>mydiff_targets_20p = get.methylDiff(mydiff_targets, difference = 1, qvalue = 0.05)</div><div> </div><div>Sample output:</div><div><table style=\"width:336pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"448\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col style=\"width:48pt\" span=\"7\" width=\"64\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"20\" width=\"64\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><table style=\"width:346pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"460\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col style=\"width:48pt\" width=\"64\">\r\n <col style=\"width:53pt\" span=\"2\" width=\"70\">\r\n <col style=\"width:48pt\" span=\"4\" width=\"64\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n  <td style=\"border:0.5pt solid windowtext;width:48pt;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"20\" width=\"64\">chr</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:53pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"70\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">start</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:53pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"70\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">end</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">strand</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">pvalue</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">qvalue</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">meth.diff</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"20\">chr6</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\" align=\"right\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">25758574</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\" align=\"right\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">25760493</font></td>\r\n  <td style=